get.summary:
The trace explorer: spans across every run the caller may open, newest
first, narrowed by agent, kind, tool, host, run, time and decision;
paged with `before` (members and above).

monthly_token_budget.description:
Tokens (in + out) the workspace may spend per calendar month (UTC);
`null` for no limit. New plans, runs and assistant calls are refused
once it is reached; work already running finishes.
